WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.351
Ubersight trend layers work down from cultural drivers,

00:00:03.401 --> 00:00:04.448
to macro trends,

00:00:04.498 --> 00:00:05.544
to micro trends,

00:00:05.594 --> 00:00:08.650
and finally to the tension where the opportunity sits.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:10.473
Take drinking.

00:00:10.523 --> 00:00:12.041
The driver is health.

00:00:12.091 --> 00:00:13.940
The macro trend is wellness.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.037
The micro trend is mocktails on a night out.

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:19.086
Here's the tension.

00:00:19.136 --> 00:00:22.400
People want to cut back, but still feel part of the party.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:26.195
A premium alcohol-free drink that looks the part resolves it.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.100
Use it like this:

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:28.950
trace a trend down the layers,

00:00:28.964 --> 00:00:32.522
then build your idea on the tension.
